#: assets/js/app.js:47562
msgid "Minn is a reimagined WordPress admin."
msgstr "Minn adalah admin WordPress yang dibayangkan ulang."

#: assets/js/app.js:47562
msgid "A calm, fast surface for the work you do every day: writing, moderating, uploading, and keeping an eye on the site. Classic wp-admin stays fully available, one click away."
msgstr "Permukaan yang tenang dan cepat untuk pekerjaan yang Anda lakukan setiap hari: menulis, memoderasi, mengunggah, dan mengawasi situs. wp-admin klasik tetap tersedia sepenuhnya, satu klik saja."

#: assets/js/app.js:47564
msgid "Getting around"
msgstr "Cara berkeliling"

#: assets/js/app.js:47565
msgid "The sidebar has three groups: Workspace (the daily material), Tools (what your plugins add) and Manage (the site itself). The fastest way anywhere is the command palette:"
msgstr "Bilah sisi memiliki tiga grup: Ruang kerja (materi harian), Perkakas (yang ditambahkan plugin Anda), dan Kelola (situs itu sendiri). Cara tercepat ke mana pun adalah palet perintah:"

#: assets/js/app.js:47565
msgid ", then start typing a view, a post or a command."
msgstr ", lalu mulai ketik tampilan, pos, atau perintah."

#: assets/js/app.js:47567
msgid "Flip to the site and back"
msgstr "Balik ke situs dan kembali"

#: assets/js/app.js:47574
msgid "The tile in the corner crosses over. Here, the site icon at the top of the sidebar opens your site, and the site name beside it returns to Overview. Out on the site, the Minn admin bar puts an m tile in the same corner that brings you back (turn the bar on from Your profile). One click each way."
msgstr "Ubin di sudut melintang. Di sini, ikon situs di bagian atas bar samping akan membuka situs Anda, dan nama situs di sampingnya kembali ke Ikhtisar. Di situs, bilah admin Minn menempatkan ubin m di sudut yang sama yang membawa Anda kembali (aktifkan bilah dari Profil Anda). Satu klik sekali jalan."

#: assets/js/app.js:47577
msgid "Right-click almost anything"
msgstr "Klik kanan hampir apa pun"

#: assets/js/app.js:47578
msgid "One of Minn’s hidden gems: almost everything here answers a right-click with a menu of quick actions. Try it on rows in Content and Media, comments, the theme button, plugin entries in the sidebar, and group headings in the block library. When in doubt, right-click."
msgstr "Salah satu permata tersembunyi Minn: hampir semua yang ada di sini menjawab klik kanan dengan menu tindakan cepat. Cobalah pada baris di Konten dan Media, komentar, tombol tema, entri plugin di sidebar, dan judul grup di perpustakaan blok. Jika ragu, klik kanan."

#: assets/js/app.js:47580
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "Jadikan milik Anda"

#: assets/js/app.js:47581
msgid "Anything a plugin adds here can be hidden for you alone: right-click its sidebar entry or block-library heading and choose Hide. Everything hidden is listed on Your profile, where one click restores it."
msgstr "Apa pun yang ditambahkan plugin di sini dapat disembunyikan hanya untuk Anda: klik kanan entri bilah sisinya atau judul pustaka blok dan pilih Sembunyikan. Semua yang tersembunyi tercantum di Profil Anda, tempat satu klik mengembalikannya."

